  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NPM CELPA &#x2013; ACAD Organizational Development for Social Service</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal is a reflective well-functioning civil society actor. The project seeks to open the space available for women, and to strengthen the ethics at every level of leadership. Church leaders (both men and women) participate in workshops, discussions and reflections about gender and theology, and about Christian leadership. Guidelines for collaboration at different levels are established. 1200 church leaders from the whole of DR Congo, as per divided in church regions, are targeted.</narrative>
  </description>
